tutorial-server-preset-title = The Functional Tutorial Server
tutorial-server-preset-description = Solo job and antagonist tutorials on private maps. Press Join in the lobby to open the tutorial picker. No player chat. Use the Choose a tutorial action (dollar sign) to switch roles.
tutorial-server-dead-chat-disabled = Dead chat is disabled on the tutorial server. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window, or right-click yourself) to open the role picker.
tutorial-server-looc-disabled = LOOC is disabled on the tutorial server.
tutorial-server-ghost-roles-disabled = Ghost roles are disabled on the tutorial server. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window, or right-click yourself) to open the role picker.
tutorial-server-picker-title = Choose a tutorial
tutorial-server-picker-subtitle = Pick any job or antagonist. Grey entries are incomplete stubs.
tutorial-server-picker-quit = Quit
tutorial-server-picker-quit-tip = You left the role picker. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window, or right-click yourself as a ghost) to open it again.
tutorial-server-ghost-choose = Choose a tutorial
tutorial-server-ghost-choose-desc = Open the Tutorial Server role picker. Click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window.
tutorial-server-join-round-not-started = Wait until the round starts.
tutorial-server-join-round-already-in-game = You are already in the round.
tutorial-server-join-round-not-tutorial = The tutorial server is not active.
ent-ActionTutorialChooseRole = Choose a tutorial
    .desc = Open the Tutorial Server role picker. Click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window.
tutorial-server-choose-action-off-hotbar = You removed [color=#FFD24A][bold]Choose a tutorial[/bold][/color] from your action bar. Press [color=#FFD24A][bold][keybind="OpenAbilitiesMenu"][/bold][/color] to open the actions menu, then drag [color=#FFD24A][bold]Choose a tutorial[/bold][/color] (dollar sign) back onto your action bar.
tutorial-server-guide-tip = Urist McTutorial is in your off-hand (left). Activate it anytime to reopen the checklist. You can drop it with Q (default) if you need both hands free.
tutorial-server-guide-highlight = Tutorial coach
tutorial-server-mentor-default-name = Urist McMentor
tutorial-server-mentor-tip = Your mentor talks you through each step. Empty-hand click them to hear the next thing sooner, or to continue when a step only needs acknowledging.
tutorial-server-mentor-highlight = Tutorial mentor
tutorial-server-progress-toast = Next: {$text}
tutorial-server-prompt-hint = Hint
tutorial-server-picker-stub-entry = stub {$name}
tutorial-server-picker-species-entry = {$name} (not for your species)
tutorial-server-picker-species-tooltip = Your current character's species is not fit for this tutorial.
tutorial-server-stub-confirm-text = This tutorial is incomplete (stub). Continue anyway?
tutorial-server-stub-confirm-button = Play stub
tutorial-server-stub-cancel-button = Cancel
tutorial-server-stub-confirm-needed = Confirm that you want to play this incomplete stub tutorial.
tutorial-server-role-species-blocked = That tutorial is not available for your current character's species.
tutorial-server-map-load-failed = Failed to load the tutorial map. Try another role or contact an admin.
tutorial-server-acknowledge = Continue
tutorial-server-step-hud = Step {$current}/{$total}: {$text}
tutorial-server-goal-hud = Goal {$current}/{$total}: {$title}
tutorial-server-subgoal-hud = Now: {$text} ({$current}/{$total})
tutorial-server-complete = Tutorial complete!
tutorial-server-chamber-pad = Walk through the chamber door and stand on the glowing purple X in the next room.
tutorial-server-chamber-pad-hint = Use the single open door between rooms, then stand on the purple floor marker.
tutorial-server-chamber-pad-stuck = Ignore sealed vault doors ? they are not the path. Only the unbolted chamber door leads forward. Stand on the glowing purple X until this step completes.
tutorial-server-prompt-title = Tutorial
tutorial-server-prompt-back = Back
tutorial-server-prompt-next = Next
tutorial-server-prompt-waiting = Waiting for you to complete this step in the world.
tutorial-server-prompt-no-tutorial = You are not in a tutorial.
tutorial-server-prompt-past-step = Previously completed step {$index}.


tutorial-server-tutorial-finished = Tutorial finished. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.
tutorial-server-tutorial-finished-hint = Tutorial finished. Use the [color=#FFD24A][bold]Choose a tutorial[/bold][/color] action to pick another.
tutorial-stub-explore-gear = This is a stub tutorial. Explore your gear and the practice room.
tutorial-stub-ghost-when-done = When finished, use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another tutorial.
tutorial-server-rules-title = Tutorial Server Rules
tutorial-server-objective-issuer = The Syndicate (Tutorial)
tutorial-server-objective-issuer-curriculum = Tutorial
tutorial-server-objective-goal-pending = Upcoming tutorial goal.
tutorial-server-objective-goal-done = Goal complete.
tutorial-server-obj-kill-name = Assassinate John Doe
tutorial-server-obj-kill-desc = Placeholder traitor kill objective for practice. No real target exists.
tutorial-server-obj-steal-name = Steal the captain's antique laser gun
tutorial-server-obj-steal-desc = Placeholder steal objective for practice. No real item is required.
tutorial-server-obj-escape-name = Escape to CentComm alive and unrestrained
tutorial-server-obj-escape-desc = Placeholder escape objective for practice.
tutorial-antag-traitor-intro = You are practicing as a Traitor. Open your Character menu to see example objectives.
tutorial-antag-traitor-objectives = Review the plain-text placeholder objectives. They illustrate what real objectives look like.
tutorial-antag-traitor-uplink = In a real round you would use your uplink. Explore your gear here safely.
tutorial-antag-traitor-done = Traitor tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-passenger-intro = This is the Passenger / Assistant basics tutorial for general station mechanics.
tutorial-job-passenger-duties = Learn pickup, inventory, drinking, and crowbarring before taking a specialized job.
tutorial-job-passenger-gear = Practice with everyday tools: crowbar, flashlight, and a water bottle.
tutorial-job-passenger-done = Basics complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to try another tutorial.

tutorial-job-bartender-intro = You are the Bartender. You run the bar and serve drinks.
tutorial-job-bartender-duties = Mix drinks, keep the bar stocked, and handle rowdy patrons carefully.
tutorial-job-bartender-gear = Use your shaker, glasses, and booze-o-mat. Practice pouring a simple drink.
tutorial-job-bartender-done = Bartender tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-botanist-intro = You are a Botanist. You grow plants for food, medicine, and more.
tutorial-job-botanist-duties = Plant seeds, water trays, harvest crops, and deliver produce.
tutorial-job-botanist-gear = Use trays, seeds, and hydroponics tools in your kit.
tutorial-job-botanist-done = Botany tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-chef-intro = You are the Chef. You cook food for the crew.
tutorial-job-chef-duties = Prepare ingredients, cook meals, and keep the kitchen stocked.
tutorial-job-chef-gear = Use your knife, microwave/grill, and kitchen machines.
tutorial-job-chef-done = Chef tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-chaplain-intro = You are the Chaplain. You tend to crew morale and the chapel.
tutorial-job-chaplain-duties = Hold services, comfort crew, and protect the chapel.
tutorial-job-chaplain-gear = Familiarize yourself with your bible and chapel equipment.
tutorial-job-chaplain-done = Chaplain tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-clown-intro = You are the Clown. Entertain the crew ? carefully.
tutorial-job-clown-duties = Perform gags, use your bike horn, and avoid crossing into grief.
tutorial-job-clown-gear = Try your horn, soap, and clown gear.
tutorial-job-clown-done = Clown tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-mime-intro = You are the Mime. Entertain through silence and gesture.
tutorial-job-mime-duties = Stay silent, perform, and use mime abilities responsibly.
tutorial-job-mime-gear = Practice your invisible wall and mime kit.
tutorial-job-mime-done = Mime tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-janitor-intro = You are the Janitor. Keep the station clean and safe underfoot.
tutorial-job-janitor-duties = Clean spills, replace lights, and restock cleaning supplies.
tutorial-job-janitor-gear = Practice with your mop, bucket, and galoshes.
tutorial-job-janitor-done = Janitor tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-cargo-technician-intro = Order cargo, haul a crate to sell at the ATS, and bring your purchase home.
tutorial-job-cargo-technician-duties = Order cargo, haul crates, pilot the shuttle, sell at the ATS, retrieve purchases, and dock home.
tutorial-job-cargo-technician-gear = Practice with the Cargo Request Computer, shuttle helm, sell pallets, and buy pallets.
tutorial-job-cargo-technician-done = Cargo Tech tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-quartermaster-intro = You are the Quartermaster. Lead Cargo and manage the budget.
tutorial-job-quartermaster-duties = Approve orders, organize techs, and keep cargo running.
tutorial-job-quartermaster-gear = Review your QM gear, console access, and headset.
tutorial-job-quartermaster-done = QM tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-chemist-intro = You are a Chemist. Manufacture medicines and chemicals.
tutorial-job-chemist-duties = Use chem dispensers, beakers, and machines to make meds.
tutorial-job-chemist-gear = Inspect your beakers, pills, and chemistry tools.
tutorial-job-chemist-done = Chemist tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-medical-doctor-intro = You are a Medical Doctor. Treat the injured and sick.
tutorial-job-medical-doctor-duties = Diagnose damage, apply medicine, and use medical scanners.
tutorial-job-medical-doctor-gear = Practice with your scanner, topicals, and medical belt.
tutorial-job-medical-doctor-done = Doctor tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-chief-medical-officer-intro = You are the CMO. Lead Medical and set treatment priorities.
tutorial-job-chief-medical-officer-duties = Coordinate doctors, manage chemistry, and handle crises.
tutorial-job-chief-medical-officer-gear = Review CMO access, hypospray, and command headset.
tutorial-job-chief-medical-officer-done = CMO tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-scientist-intro = You are a Scientist. Research technologies and anomalies.
tutorial-job-scientist-duties = Unlock research, study artifacts, and support robotics.
tutorial-job-scientist-gear = Check your PDA research tools and lab access.
tutorial-job-scientist-done = Scientist tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-research-director-intro = You are the Research Director. Lead Science.
tutorial-job-research-director-duties = Set research priorities and keep the lab safe.
tutorial-job-research-director-gear = Review RD access, teleport controls, and command gear.
tutorial-job-research-director-done = RD tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-station-engineer-intro = You are a Station Engineer. Power, repair, and build.
tutorial-job-station-engineer-duties = Set up power, fix breaches, and maintain the station.
tutorial-job-station-engineer-gear = Practice with tools, insulated gloves, and a welder.
tutorial-job-station-engineer-done = Engineer tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-chief-engineer-intro = You are the Chief Engineer. Lead Engineering and Atmos.
tutorial-job-chief-engineer-duties = Oversee power/atmos and coordinate engineers.
tutorial-job-chief-engineer-gear = Review CE access, hardsuit options, and command gear.
tutorial-job-chief-engineer-done = CE tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-security-officer-intro = You are a Security Officer. Keep the peace and enforce space law.
tutorial-job-security-officer-duties = Patrol, detain suspects, and bring them to processing.
tutorial-job-security-officer-gear = Practice holstering, cuffs, and your stun baton carefully.
tutorial-job-security-officer-done = Security tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-warden-intro = You are the Warden. Run the brig and armory.
tutorial-job-warden-duties = Process prisoners, manage timers, and secure the armory.
tutorial-job-warden-gear = Review brig gear, doors, and warden equipment.
tutorial-job-warden-done = Warden tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-head-of-security-intro = You are the Head of Security. Lead Security.
tutorial-job-head-of-security-duties = Coordinate officers, set alerts, and handle major threats.
tutorial-job-head-of-security-gear = Review HoS access, weapons policy, and command gear.
tutorial-job-head-of-security-done = HoS tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-captain-intro = You are the Captain. Command the station.
tutorial-job-captain-duties = Lead department heads, protect the disk, and make hard calls.
tutorial-job-captain-gear = Review your spare ID, disk responsibility, and command gear.
tutorial-job-captain-done = Captain tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.

tutorial-job-head-of-personnel-intro = You are the Head of Personnel. Manage jobs and IDs.
tutorial-job-head-of-personnel-duties = Assign jobs, update IDs, and oversee Service.
tutorial-job-head-of-personnel-gear = Practice with the ID console concepts and HoP access.
tutorial-job-head-of-personnel-done = HoP tutorial complete. Use the Choose a tutorial action (click the dollar sign on the left side of the game window) to pick another role.


